<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>One with Thee, Thou Son incarnate,</l><l>Born with Thee, the Man of worth,</l><l>We, the members of Thy body,</l><l>Sojourn with Thee here on earth.</l><l>One with Thee, Thou Son anointed,</l><l>Sharing too the Spirit’s power,</l><l>We in full cooperation</l><l>Labor with Thee hour by hour.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>One with Thee, Thou Son forsaken,</l><l>Judgment and the curse we’ve passed;</l><l>We to sin are dead forever,</l><l>Hell beneath our feet is cast.</l><l>One with Thee in resurrection,</l><l>Death can never us oppress;</l><l>Live we in Thy new creation,</l><l>Bearing fruits of righteousness.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>One with Thee, Thou Son ascended,</l><l>Seated with Thee on the throne,</l><l>Thine authority we share and</l><l>Rule with Thee, Thy rank our own.</l><l>One with Thee, Thou Son returning,</l><l>Glorified with Thee we’ll be,</l><l>E’er to manifest Thy beauty,</l><l>One with Thee eternally.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
